1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.200
Welcome to Kloud Koach, your AI-powered interview coach.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.290
Let's take a quick tour — first, create your free account in just a few seconds.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.700
This is your dashboard — home base for every coaching tool Kloud Koach offers.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.090
Three ways to practice, plus tools to prep your resume and study materials.

5
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.000
Live Interview Co-Pilot listens in on a real interview call in another tab,

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
and quietly suggests answers in real time.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.350
It's meant to help you think clearly — not to answer for you.

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:36.000
Interview Preparation lets you rehearse out loud with your microphone.

9
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.070
Ask a practice question, and get a natural, spoken-style answer tailored to your resume.

10
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.000
AI Interviewer takes it further.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A simulated interviewer asks real questions out loud, tailored to your resume.

12
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.350
and gives you a full score and feedback at the end.

13
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:59.000
Upload your resume, and Kloud Koach AI structures it automatically.

14
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.500
You can even tailor it to a specific job description with one click.

15
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.970
Exam prep, session history, and plan upgrades are all just as easy to find.

16
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.000
That's Kloud Koach.

17
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.350
Log in, pick a mode, and start practicing. Good luck out there.
